# SwiftLint version used by this repository.
#
# The first entry is canonical: CI downloads that release's
# `portable_swiftlint.zip`, and local development must match it. SwiftLint
# changes rules and thresholds between minor releases, so an unpinned
# `brew install swiftlint` can turn a green branch red (or hide a new
# violation) without any code change.
#
# The remaining entries are builds verified to produce an identical violation
# set on this tree. Never add an entry without running
# `scripts/check-swiftlint-version.sh` plus `swiftlint lint --strict` on the
# whole repository.
